Lifetime-SL (Crystals): (As Manufactured by FMC):

To control alkali-silica reactivity (ASR) in concrete, add the same
weight of Lifetime-SL per yard as the sodium equivalent supplied
by the cement. For example, if there six hundred (600) pounds of
cement per cubic yard of concrete, and the sodium equivalent of
the cement per cubic yard of concrete, and the sodium equivalent
