ACCESS TO MANHOLES

1.
Paved or gravel road access shall be provided to all
manholes that are to be owned and maintained by the
BOPU, which are on sewer mains that are twelve (12) inch
in diameter or smaller.

F.
When a manhole is in anticipated or actual groundwater
conditions, a water proofing coating must be applied to the outside
