3.06
PROTECTION

A.
The CONTRACTOR shall always have materials available to
protect the surface of the plastic concrete against rain. These
materials shall consist of waterproof paper or plastic sheeting. For
slipform construction, materials such as wood planks or forms to
protect the edges shall also be required.

